[2px] transition-opacity duration-300 opacity-0"></div><div id="site-mobile-navigation-drawer" role="dialog" aria-label="Mobile navigation" aria-hidden="true" class="neo-header-drawer absolute right-0 top-0 z-10 flex h-full w-[min(88vw,380px)] flex-col border-l shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl transition-transform duration-300 ease-out translate-x-full"><div class="neo-header-drawer-head flex h-16 shrink-0 items-center justify-end border-b px-5 sm:h-[72px] sm:px-6"><button type="button" aria-label="Close navigation" class="neo-header-menu flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border transition"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">close</span></button></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col gap-2 overflow-y-auto p-5 sm:p-6"><p class="px-2 pb-2 text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gray-400">Explore EdiCut</p><a class="neo-header-link type-menu flex min-h-12 items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:bg-black/5 " href="/" data-discover="true">Home<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] opacity-50">arrow_forward</span></a><a class="neo-header-link type-menu flex min-h-12 items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:bg-black/5 " href="/pricing" data-discover="true">Pricing<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] opacity-50">arrow_forward</span></a><a class="neo-header-link type-menu flex min-h-12 items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:bg-black/5 " href="/portfolio" data-discover="true">Portfolio<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] opacity-50">arrow_forward</span></a><a class="neo-header-link type-menu flex min-h-12 items-center justify-between rounded-xl px-4 py-3 transition-colors hover:bg-black/5 " href="/contact" data-discover="true">Contact<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] opacity-50">arrow_forward</span></a></div><div class="border-t border-black/5 p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="neo-mobile-support sm:hidden"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_7mcj5_" class="neo-button neo-button--primary neo-mobile-support-trigger w-full justify-center uppercase tracking-[0.14em]"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px]" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble_outline</span>Chat with us<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">expand_less</span></button><div id="_R_7mcj5_" hidden="" class="neo-mobile-support-card rounded-2xl p-2"><a href="https://wa.me/8801625957738?text=Hi%20EdiCut%2C%20I&#x27;d%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20video%20editing." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Chat on WhatsApp" class="neo-button neo-button--primary neo-mobile-whatsapp-link w-full justify-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px]" aria-hidden="true">chat</span>WhatsApp</a></div></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--primary w-full uppercase tracking-[0.14em]" href="/signin?mode=signin&amp;redirectTo=%2Fdashboard" data-discover="true"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[19px]">login</span>Sign in</a></div></div></div><main data-analytics-region="page-content"><section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b neo-line px-5 pb-14 pt-16 sm:px-6 lg:pb-20 lg:pt-20"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 top-16 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-[#e2c9ce]/35 blur-3xl"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -left-24 bottom-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-[#cbdbe8]/60 blur-3xl"></div><div class="relative mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center"><div class="neo-pill inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-4 py-2 yt-tag tracking-[0.16em] neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg>Terms of Service</div><h1 class="yt-display mt-7 neo-ink">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p class="yt-subtitle mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl leading-8 neo-muted">The service agreement, turnaround expectations, and revision terms for working with EdiCut.</p><p class="mt-4 yt-small font-black neo-muted">Effective Date: October 1, 2026</p></div></section><section class="border-b neo-line px-5 py-20 sm:px-6"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl"><div class="neo-surface rounded-[2rem] p-6 sm:p-10 lg:p-12 space-y-8"><article class="neo-card rounded-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">assignment</span></span><h2 class="text-xl font-black neo-ink">1. Service Scope &amp; Editing Lanes</h2></div><p class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed neo-muted pl-12">EdiCut provides video editing, pacing optimization, sound mixing, color grading, thumbnail packaging, and review workflows according to the monthly plan or custom project scope confirmed with you.</p></article><article class="neo-card rounded-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">folder_shared</span></span><h2 class="text-xl font-black neo-ink">2. Creator Responsibilities</h2></div><p class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed neo-muted pl-12">Creators are responsible for providing usable raw footage, brand assets, references, clear briefs, and lawful intellectual property rights for all source media provided for editing.</p></article><article class="neo-card rounded-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">rate_review</span></span><h2 class="text-xl font-black neo-ink">3. Revisions, Approvals &amp; Turnaround</h2></div><p class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed neo-muted pl-12">The first cut is delivered within 48 hours, and each package includes the listed revision rounds. Send revision feedback with timestamps; approval of a final deliverable confirms project stage completion.</p></article><article class="neo-card rounded-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">credit_card</span></span><h2 class="text-xl font-black neo-ink">4. Estimates, Billing &amp; Cancellation</h2></div><p class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed neo-muted pl-12">Published monthly package prices cover the listed scope. Submitting a project request does not start a subscription or collect payment. EdiCut confirms scope, price, billing cadence, and service terms with you before work begins. Contact support to change or cancel an active plan under its confirmed agreement.</p></article><article class="neo-card rounded-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">verified_user</span></span><h2 class="text-xl font-black neo-ink">5. Acceptable Content &amp; Rights</h2></div><p class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed neo-muted pl-12">Customers retain 100% full copyright ownership of all final delivered edits. Customers may not submit unlawful, infringing, hateful, or misleading content for post-production.</p></article><article class="neo-card rounded-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">support_agent</span></span><h2 class="text-xl font-black neo-ink">6. YouTube Review Integration</h2></div><p class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed neo-muted pl-12">Using the YouTube upload or playback features also binds you to the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline">YouTube Terms of Service</a>. Upload only videos you have permission to share as unlisted. Unlisted links can be watched or reshared by anyone who receives them. YouTube controls upload allowances, processing, compression, availability, and playback. Keep original master files in your own archive.</p></article><article class="neo-card rounded-2xl p-6"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="neo-icon-badge flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-xl"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">support_agent</span></span><h2 class="text-xl font-black neo-ink">7. Legal &amp; Support Inquiries</h2></div><p class="mt-3.5 text-sm font-medium leading-relaxed neo-muted pl-12">Questions regarding these terms or enterprise master service agreements (MSAs) can be directed to legal@edicut.com.</p></article></div></div></section><section class="neo-trust-strip border-b neo-line px-5 py-8 sm:px-6"><div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-center justify-between gap-5 sm:flex-row"><p class="yt-tag neo-section-label"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-badge-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg>A clear process for your next upload</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 yt-small font-bold neo-muted"><span>Defined editing scope</span><span>Timestamped feedback</span><span>Final export approval</span></div></div></section></main><footer data-analytics-region="footer" class="neo-footer relative overflow-hidden border-t px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="neo-footer__inner mx-auto max-w-7xl pb-5 pt-8 sm:pb-7 sm:pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-14"><div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[minmax(18rem,1.45fr)_minmax(9rem,1fr)_minmax(11rem,1fr)] md:items-stretch"><section class="neo-footer__lead flex flex-col justify-between p-5 md:p-6"><div><h2 class="type-card-title neo-footer-ink">Plan your next video</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-5 neo-footer-muted sm:text-[15px]">Tell us your video format, footage, and deadline. We will help you choose an editing package.</p></div><a class="neo-button neo-button--dark neo-button--compact mt-6 w-fit" href="/contact" data-discover="true">Discuss your project</a></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font-bold neo-footer-ink md:pointer-events-none md:border-b md:border-[var(--neo-line)] md:pb-3">Explore<span class="footer-mobile-chevron material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] transition-transform duration-200">expand_more</span></button><nav class="grid gap-2 overflow-hidden text-sm transition-[max-height,opacity,padding] duration-200 max-h-0 opacity-0 md:mt-3 md:max-h-none md:overflow-visible md:pb-0 md:opacity-100" aria-label="Explore"><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/why-hire-us" data-discover="true">Why Hire Us</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/services" data-discover="true">Services</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/pricing" data-discover="true">Pricing</a><a class="neo-footer-link transition-colors" href="/portfolio" data-discover="true">Portfolio</a></nav></section><section class="neo-footer__group"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="flex w-full items-center justify-between text-left text-sm font